Read a file by path with line numbers; supports offset and line limit (default {{ .DefaultReadLimit }}, max {{ .MaxViewSizeKB }}KB returned file content section); renders images (PNG, JPEG, GIF, WebP); pass `files` to read up to {{ .MaxFilesPerCall }} files or sections in one call (per-entry file_path, offset, limit); a directory path returns a sorted, nonrecursive listing capped at 200 entries (`offset` and `limit` paginate entries). Text reads certify only the returned ranges; truncated line tails and directory entries do not count as file reads.
